{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A RUG AS A LINE OF THE GUIDE FOR AI ASSISTANTS (Corvo addition; see templates/page.llms.liquid)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The facts of one rug in one line of plain text: its craft level, what it is made of (or the materials it can be made
in, when its customisation level lets the client choose), its pile, what a client may change on it, and its prices.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* rug: the rug (required)
* vat_plus: 100 plus the VAT rate (required)
* fx: the currency factor of the "rug-fx" snippet (required)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign craft = rug.metafields.rug.craft_level.value
  assign custom = rug.metafields.rug.customisation.value
  assign material_list = rug.metafields.rug.materials.value
  assign material_choice = false

  if custom.change_material.value and material_list.size > 1
    assign material_choice = true
  endif

  assign materials = ''

  for material in material_list
    if materials != ''
      assign materials = materials | append: ', '
    endif

    assign materials = materials | append: material.name.value

    if material_choice and material.group.value != 'Standard' and material.supplement.value != blank
      assign materials = materials | append: ' (' | append: material.supplement.value | append: ')'
    endif
  endfor

  assign own_factor = rug.metafields.rug.supplement.value | default: 0 | plus: 100 | divided_by: 100.0
  assign per_m2 = craft.retail_per_m2.value | times: own_factor | times: vat_plus | round
-%}
- [{{ rug.title }}]({{ shop.url }}{{ rug.url }}): craft level {{ craft.label.value }}{% if materials != blank %}; {% if material_choice %}made in a choice of {{ materials }}{% else %}{{ materials }}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% if rug.metafields.rug.pile_height.value != blank %}; pile {{ rug.metafields.rug.pile_height.value | downcase }}{% endif %}{% if custom %}; customisation level {{ custom.number.value }} ({{ custom.name.value | downcase }}){% endif %}; standard sizes from {{ rug.price_min | money }} to {{ rug.price_max | money }}; made to measure at {% render 'rug-money', amount: per_m2, fx: fx, exact: true %} per m², VAT included.
